# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# .env.pre.example  —  LEGACY FILE, no longer the source of truth
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# This file existed in the previous configuration system (.env.*).
# All non-secret values it contained have been migrated to:
#
#   params/base/params.yml       ← shared defaults
#   params/pre/params.yml        ← pre-production overrides
#
# The only values that should be in an .env file are secrets:
#
#   API_KEY, OPENROUTER_API_KEY, TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN, SUPABASE_*, etc.
#
# Copy the secrets template with:
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# This file can be safely deleted.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════


# Pre-production Settings
APP_ENV=pre
APP_DEBUG=False
LOG_LEVEL=INFO
RELOAD=False

# Server
HOST=0.0.0.0
PORT=8000

# LLM Configuration - MUST be set for pre-production
LLM_PROVIDER=openrouter
LLM_MODEL=meta-llama/llama-3.1-70b-instruct
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=REQUIRED-SET-IN-.env.local

# Supabase - Recommended for pre-production
# SUPABASE_URL=https://your-preprod-project.supabase.co
# SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=REQUIRED-SET-IN-.env.local
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=REQUIRED-SET-IN-.env.local

# Telegram - Optional for pre-production
# TELEGRAM_ENABLED=False
# TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=REQUIRED-SET-IN-.env.local

# Pre-production Features
MCP_ENABLED=True
ENABLE_STRUCTURED_LOGS=True
ENABLE_METRICS=True
ALLOW_AGENT_REGISTRATION=True

# ─── Security ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
API_KEY_ENABLED=true
# API_KEY=SET-IN-.env.local
CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS=https://your-staging-domain.com

# Telegram allowlist — restrict to known IDs in pre
# TELEGRAM_ALLOWED_USER_IDS=123456789,987654321

# ─── Execution Limits (semi-strict) ────────────────────────────────────────
MAX_MODEL_CALLS_PER_TURN=2
MAX_TOOL_CALLS_PER_TURN=10
MAX_AGENT_TURNS=500
MAX_INPUT_CHARS=8000
MAX_OUTPUT_CHARS=12000
AGENT_TIMEOUT_SECONDS=45
